IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q15-LATE-PENALTY.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INSTALMENT      PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-DAYS-LATE       PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-EFF-DAYS        PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
01 WS-PENALTY         PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL-PAYABLE   PIC 9(10)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISP-PEN        PIC Z(8)9.99.
01 WS-DISP-TOT        PIC Z(9)9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-INSTALMENT
ACCEPT WS-DAYS-LATE
IF WS-DAYS-LATE > 10
    MOVE 10 TO WS-EFF-DAYS
ELSE
    MOVE WS-DAYS-LATE TO WS-EFF-DAYS
END-IF
COMPUTE WS-PENALTY ROUNDED = (WS-INSTALMENT * WS-EFF-DAYS) / 100
COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-PAYABLE = WS-INSTALMENT + WS-PENALTY
MOVE WS-PENALTY TO WS-DISP-PEN
MOVE WS-TOTAL-PAYABLE TO WS-DISP-TOT
DISPLAY "Penalty: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-PEN)
DISPLAY "Total payable: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-TOT)
STOP RUN.
